  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the curves, <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> touch each other at a point, then the largest value of <math><mi>k</mi></math> is ____________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "36",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If general equation of circle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;then its center is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and radius is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Two circles touches each other if <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi></mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#177;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Distance between <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is either&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>k</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;Maximum value of <math><mi>k</mi></math> is <math><mn>36</mn></math>.</p>",
